ring r = (27,a), (x(1..5), t), dp;
proc elv(list vl, int k) { if (k < 0) {return(0);} if (k == 0) {return(1);} if (k > size(vl)) {return(0);}
  list w = delete(vl, size(vl)); return(elv(w, k) + vl[size(vl)] * elv(w, k-1)); }
list X; int p; for (p = 1; p <= 5; p++) { X = insert(X, x(p), size(X)); }
list SA = list(a^0, a^0, a^1);
ideal I; int j; int rr; poly g;
for (j = 1; j <= 8; j = j + 2) { g = 0; for (rr = 0; rr <= 3; rr++) { g = g + elv(SA, rr) * elv(X, j - rr); } I = I, homog(g, t); }
for (j = 1; j <= 5; j++) { I = I, x(j)^27 - x(j)*t^26; }
degBound = 0; int t0 = timer; ideal G = std(I); degBound = 0;
ideal T; int i; poly h; for (i = 1; i <= size(G); i++) { h = G[i]; while ((h != 0) && (subst(h, t, 0) == 0)) { h = h / t; } T = T, subst(h, t, 0); }
ideal K = t; for (j = 1; j <= 5; j++) { K = K, x(j)^27; if ((j mod 2 == 1) || (j >= 3)) { K = K, elv(X, j); } }
K = K, elv(list(x(1), x(2), x(3), x(4)), 4);
K = K, elv(list(x(1), x(2), x(3), x(5)), 4);
K = K, elv(list(x(1), x(2), x(4), x(5)), 4);
K = K, elv(list(x(1), x(3), x(4), x(5)), 4);
K = K, elv(list(x(2), x(3), x(4), x(5)), 4);
int l; list P;
for (j = 1; j <= 5; j++) { for (l = 1; l <= 5; l++) { if (j != l) { P = list(); for (p = 1; p <= 5; p++) { if ((p != j) && (p != l)) { P = insert(P, x(p), size(P)); } }
  h = 0; for (i = 0; i <= 1; i++) { h = h + x(j)^(25 + i) * elv(P, 2 - i); } K = K, h; } } }
K = K, x(2)*x(3)*x(4)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)*x(3)*x(4)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)*x(2)*x(4)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)*x(2)*x(3)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)*x(2)*x(3)*x(4);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(4)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(3)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(3)*x(4);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(2)*x(5);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(2)*x(4);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(2)*x(3);
K = K, x(2)^26*x(4)*x(5);
K = K, x(2)^26*x(3)*x(5);
K = K, x(2)^26*x(3)*x(4);
K = K, x(2)^26*x(1)*x(5);
K = K, x(2)^26*x(1)*x(4);
K = K, x(2)^26*x(1)*x(3);
K = K, x(3)^26*x(4)*x(5);
K = K, x(3)^26*x(2)*x(5);
K = K, x(3)^26*x(2)*x(4);
K = K, x(3)^26*x(1)*x(5);
K = K, x(3)^26*x(1)*x(4);
K = K, x(3)^26*x(1)*x(2);
K = K, x(4)^26*x(3)*x(5);
K = K, x(4)^26*x(2)*x(5);
K = K, x(4)^26*x(2)*x(3);
K = K, x(4)^26*x(1)*x(5);
K = K, x(4)^26*x(1)*x(3);
K = K, x(4)^26*x(1)*x(2);
K = K, x(5)^26*x(3)*x(4);
K = K, x(5)^26*x(2)*x(4);
K = K, x(5)^26*x(2)*x(3);
K = K, x(5)^26*x(1)*x(4);
K = K, x(5)^26*x(1)*x(3);
K = K, x(5)^26*x(1)*x(2);
K = K, x(1)^26*x(2)^26;
K = K, x(1)^26*x(3)^26;
K = K, x(1)^26*x(4)^26;
K = K, x(1)^26*x(5)^26;
K = K, x(2)^26*x(3)^26;
K = K, x(2)^26*x(4)^26;
K = K, x(2)^26*x(5)^26;
K = K, x(3)^26*x(4)^26;
K = K, x(3)^26*x(5)^26;
K = K, x(4)^26*x(5)^26;
ideal SK = std(K); ideal ST = std(T + ideal(t));
int kin = 1; for (i = 1; i <= size(K); i++) { if (reduce(K[i], ST) != 0) { kin = 0; } }
int fib = 0;
"RESULT q=27 mu=(2, 1) n=5 f=2: vdim(unifK) =", vdim(SK), " vdim(tops) =", vdim(ST), " K<=tops:", kin, " sec:", timer - t0;
ideal N; for (i = 1; i <= size(T); i++) { h = reduce(T[i], SK); if (h != 0) { N = N, h; } } N = simplify(N, 2);
ideal M2 = K; ideal SM = SK; ideal NEW; for (i = 1; i <= size(N); i++) { if (reduce(N[i], SM) != 0) { NEW = NEW, N[i]; M2 = M2, N[i]; SM = std(M2); } } NEW = simplify(NEW, 2);
string dg = ""; for (i = 1; i <= size(NEW); i++) { dg = dg + string(deg(NEW[i])) + " "; }
"  NEW beyond K:", size(NEW), " degrees:", dg;
ideal S2; int aa; int cc; int dd; int nsq = 0; int nsqin = 0; int nhv = 0; int nhvin = 0; list V2; poly Dd;
for (j = 1; j <= 5; j++) { for (cc = 1; cc <= 5; cc++) { for (dd = 1; dd <= 5; dd++) { if ((j != cc) && (j != dd) && (cc < dd)) {
  V2 = list(); for (p = 1; p <= 5; p++) { if ((p != cc) && (p != dd)) { V2 = insert(V2, x(p)); } }
  Dd = x(j)^25 * elv(V2, 1);
  h = x(cc)^2 * Dd; nsq++; if (reduce(h, ST) == 0) { nsqin++; } S2 = S2, h; h = x(dd)^2 * Dd; nsq++; if (reduce(h, ST) == 0) { nsqin++; } S2 = S2, h;
  for (aa = 1; aa <= 5; aa++) { if ((aa != j) && (aa != cc) && (aa != dd)) { h = x(aa)^25 * Dd; nhv++; if (reduce(h, ST) == 0) { nhvin++; } S2 = S2, h; } } } } } }
ideal SKS = std(K + S2); int okS = 1; for (i = 1; i <= size(T); i++) { if (reduce(T[i], SKS) != 0) { okS = 0; } }
int redS = 1; for (i = 1; i <= size(S2); i++) { if (reduce(S2[i], SK) != 0) { redS = 0; } }
"  LAW y_c^2 D:", nsqin, "/", nsq, " y_a^(q-2) D:", nhvin, "/", nhv, " in tops ; vdim(K+S2) =", vdim(SKS), " ; K+S2 contains tops:", okS, " ; S2 inside unifK (redundant):", redS;
"  total sec:", timer - t0;
quit;
